{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261It6w53DkH1795016682.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一道冷鋒橫過廣東沿岸地區，本港多區晚間氣溫較日間低5至7度。天文台預測周六新界部分地區最低氣溫會跌到9至10度，呼籲市民注意保暖。</p><p></p><p>入夜後氣溫明顯轉涼，在旺角不少人都要穿上外套及長袖衫。一道冷鋒橫過廣東沿岸地區，本港受到與冷鋒相關的強烈東北季候風，及雲雨帶影響，多區氣溫晚上約20度左右，較日間低至少5至7度，天文台發出特別天氣提示，指未來一兩日天氣顯著轉涼，周五市區氣溫會由午夜約18度，下降至最低約15度，新界再低兩三度，內陸地區及高地寒冷更預測周六分區氣溫，大老山、昂平最低跌至9度，打鼓嶺跌至10度。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-2300 -1_CLEAN_20261118_233230.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SJhZ2BMRCA1795017143.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>天文台科學主任黃子鈞說：「星期五及星期六風勢會較大，高地風寒效都會較明顯，市民特別是進行戶外活動的人士，請留意天氣變化，注意保暖。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-2300 -1_CLEAN_20261118_233230_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SxqChOSYS51795017163.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>天文台預料一股偏東氣流，會在下周初影響華南沿岸，到時氣溫會稍為回升。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.hko.gov.hk/tc/wxinfo/currwx/fnd.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九天天氣預報</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T17:04:27.894901+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":363,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T15:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:47:06.086469+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T16:57:41.642796+00:00","content_hash":"e188eb3da477ecc1921629e88c57c59a730d612e270a00b042ac9af076a16838","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T17:04:27.894901+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}